OL,3,AThree men found guilty of murdering
OL,4,AAustralian brothers and US friend in
OL,5,AMexico
OL,6,
OL,7,FThree men have been found guilty of
OL,8,Fmurdering Australian brothers Jake and
OL,9,FCallum Robinson, and their US friend
OL,10,FCarter Rhoad during a surfing trip in
OL,11,FMexico in 2024.
OL,13,FThe men's full names could not be given
OL,14,Ffor legal reasons, and they were only
OL,15,Fidentified as Jesus Gerardo, Irineo
OL,16,FFrancisco and Angel Jesus. They are yet
OL,17,Fto be sentenced - but are likely to
OL,18,Fspend the rest of their lives in a
OL,19,Fprison.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
