OL,3,AThree men found guilty of murdering
OL,4,AAustralian brothers and US friend in
OL,5,AMexico
OL,6,
OL,7,FDebra Robinson, the brothers' mother,
OL,8,Ftold the courtroom that her sons'
OL,9,Fmurders had taken "the future we had
OL,10,Fimagined with them".
OL,12,FDuring the trial in the northern Baja
OL,13,FCalifornia state, the court heard that
OL,14,Fthe tourists were killed in an apparent
OL,15,Fbotched robbery of their truck in a
OL,16,Fsecluded beach area.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
